# Product pages are frozen

The owner froze all product pages. Do not modify them — prices, copy, images, layout, or formatting — until the owner explicitly says they can be changed again.

This covers:
- `src/app/product/[slug]/page.tsx`
- `src/components/shop/SmartTagStory.tsx` and other product-page components in `src/components/shop/`
- Product seed files in `src/lib/seed*.ts` (prices, names, descriptions, landing content)
- Price formatting in `src/lib/currency.ts` and `src/lib/pricing.ts`
- Product merge logic in `src/context/StoreContext.tsx`

If a request would touch any of these, stop and ask the owner first.
